{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2022-05-04 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS APRIL SALES RESULTS', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., MAY 04, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY REPORTED NET SALES OF $17.33 BILLION FOR THE RETAIL MONTH OF APRIL, THE FOUR WEEKS ENDED MAY 1, 2022, AN INCREASE OF 13.9 PERCENT FROM $15.21 BILLION LAST YEAR.'}